 "notes": [
  "Starting cards (the unlabelled first block of the list): My Lord, Is That Legal?, Coruscant: Galactic Senate, Tatooine: Desert Landing Site, Allegations Of Corruption, The Phantom Menace, Imperial Arrest Order & Secret Plans (posted 'IAO/SP'), Prepared Defenses; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Darth Maul w/ LS x3' dested Darth Maul (Tatooine): Darth Maul With Lightsaber is a Theed Palace card (December 2001), after this post, and the strategy has Maul deploying cheaply to Tatooine. 'Darth Vader w/ LS' dested the Enhanced Premiere Darth Vader With Lightsaber.",
  "Posted 'Curscant Galactic Senate' dested Coruscant: Galactic Senate; 'Tatooine DB' dested Tatooine: Docking Bay 94; 'Tatooine JP' / 'JP ...' dested Tatooine: Jabba's Palace and the Jabba's Palace sites; 'Ghhhk + TRWEU' dested Ghhhk & Those Rebels Won't Escape Us; 'Imp. Barrier' / 'Imp. Command' dested Imperial Barrier / Imperial Command; 'Weapon Lev.' dested the Cloud City Interrupt Weapon Levitation; 'Kedar the Black' dested Keder The Black; '4-lom w/ gun' dested 4-LOM With Concussion Rifle.",
  "The author says the deck went unbeaten in '3 or 4' unnamed local tournaments; the title says no Reflections III cards are used."
